{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7cebe6c4-2814-82df-8d54-57ac97f9316e",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T11:39:13-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen B. Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:55-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation, this is Beth, good morning! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:01-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'm calling to find out if the skating area is open right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:08-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The skating area, sure. Are you thinking of the rink, or is it one of the skate park spots down by the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:19-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The skate park. The one at the beach park. I drove past it and couldn't tell if it was closed off or just empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:30-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it's been a wet weekend, and when we get that much rain, the crews sometimes keep the concrete areas closed until they dry out and they've swept off the sand and debris. Let me pull up what I have. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:50-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:51-04:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. I'm showing it as open, no closure notice on it. But I'd say it's probably still damp in the low spots from the rain that ended Saturday, so it depends on who's asking. If somebody's planning to skate, I'd tell them to look it over first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:13-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not skating. I just needed to know whether it's open. Is there a sign posted if it's closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:22-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually, yes. If it's closed they put a sign or tape across the entrance. If you didn't see any, then it's open as far as I can tell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:35-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There wasn't tape that I saw. There were a few kids on the path next to it, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:44-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's pretty typical for a Monday if school's out or they've got a half day. Is there something going on there you wanted to report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:55-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of. I was driving along there this morning and a cyclist came through and nearly clipped my mirror. He was going fast and he wasn't on the path, he was in the lane right by the parking area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:36:12-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Were you okay? Did he actually hit the car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:36:18-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. He missed it by an inch or two. I'm not hurt and the car's fine. I just wondered whether the park area has any rules about bikes, or whether that's something you track."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:36:33-04:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I can tell you in general that the bike traffic around the beach parks mixes with cars and pedestrians, and we do get comments about it. I don't have a specific rule in front of me to read you for that stretch. I can write this up as a note for our parks supervisor so it's on record. Do you remember about where it was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:02-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Near the entrance to the parking area by the skate park. Right before the turn into the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:11-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Near the entrance to the lot, by the skate park, this morning. About what time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:19-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around ten past nine, give or take."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:23-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten past nine. And the cyclist, any description? Or is that more than you caught?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:30-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just a man in a dark jacket on a road bike. I didn't get anything more than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:39-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll put it in as you said it. I don't think there's much anyone can do about one rider, but if we get a few reports from that spot, it helps the supervisor decide whether signs or something else make sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:37:58-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's reasonable. Will somebody need to call me back about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:04-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say probably not. It's more of a note for the file than something that needs a response. If the supervisor wants more detail, they might call, so I can put your number on it just in case. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:25-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0154. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:30-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ellen Gifford. G-I-F-F-O-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:32-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ellen Gifford, got it. So to recap, the skate park shows as open with no closure posted, maybe damp in spots, and I've logged your report about the cyclist near the lot entrance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:47-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. So if nobody calls, I should assume that's the end of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:38:54-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. No call means it's just been filed. If something comes of it, you'd hear from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:39:02-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's what I needed. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:39:06-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ellen! Have a good rest of your Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:39:11-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
